# the SMK-37's faders and wheels (smk37.c): a fader is a track's level once it moves (FADER BANK held: tracks 5-8),
# the mod wheel CC 1 on the track shown, the pitch wheel its bend; a fader that has not moved changes nothing
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 30
expect trk 2
fader 0 64
wait 60
expect par1.LEVEL 64
fader 1 127
wait 60
expect par2.LEVEL 127
press FBANK
wait 30
fader 0 0
wait 60
expect par5.LEVEL 0
release FBANK
wait 30
expect par1.LEVEL 64
wheel mod 100
wait 60
wheel pitch 4000
wait 60
key37 12 down 90
wait 60
expect voices 1
wheel pitch 0
wait 60
key37 12 up
wait 150
shot controls.png
